{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-83406","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-117334","text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-83407","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117335","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-117336","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-117337","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-117338","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-117339","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-117340","text":" Full Implementation (OTP Supervision Tree + MCP)"}]},{"id":"blk-83408","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-117341","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-83409","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117342","text":"You are building the "},{"id":"spn-117343","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol"},{"id":"spn-117344","text":" — the enforcement runtime that sits above agents and below humans. The harness orchestrates [&] pipelines, enforces governance contracts, gates execution on epistemic confidence, and ensures no agent skips retrieval, fabricates provenance, or acts beyond its coverage."}]},{"id":"blk-83410","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117345","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/OS-008-HARNESS.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-117346","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-83411","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117347","text":"OS-008 is the "},{"id":"spn-117348","marks":["bold"],"text":"enforcement layer"},{"id":"spn-117349","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-83412","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-83413","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117350","text":"The harness wraps agents like an OTP supervisor wraps processes — it doesn't do the work, it ensures the work is done correctly."}]},{"id":"blk-83414","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-117351","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-83415","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:      Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nOTP Patterns:  DynamicSupervisor, GenServer, GenStateMachine\nMCP:           JSON-RPC over HTTP (harness_start_session, harness_sprint_status,\n               harness_approve_action, harness_escalation_response)\nIntegration:   Graphonomous MCP (memory), Delegatic (policy), OS-006 (permissions)\nAuth:          Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — workspace-scoped sessions)\nTesting:       ExUnit + property-based testing for state machine transitions\nDeploy:        Part of OpenSentience runtime (not standalone)"},{"id":"blk-83416","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-117352","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-83417","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117353","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-117354","marks":["code"],"text":"opensentience.org/lib/"},{"id":"spn-117355","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-83418","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"opensentience.org/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── open_sentience/\n│   │   ├── harness/\n│   │   │   ├── supervisor.ex           # DynamicSupervisor for harness sessions\n│   │   │   ├── session.ex              # Session GenServer — supervises one orchestrated task\n│   │   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer.ex    # Prerequisite constraint model (section 5)\n│   │   │   ├── quality_gate.ex         # Evaluator orchestrator (section 6)\n│   │   │   ├── contract_validator.ex   # [&] governance block enforcement (section 7)\n│   │   │   ├── sprint_controller.ex    # GenStateMachine — planner→generator→evaluator loop (section 9)\n│   │   │   ├── context_manager.ex      # Context window management + compaction (section 8)\n│   │   │   ├── coverage.ex             # Coverage→dispatch routing matrix (section 3.3)\n│   │   │   ├── audit_entry.ex          # Extended audit entry with provenance (section 10)\n│   │   │   ├── tier_adapter.ex         # Model tier adaptation (section 11)\n│   │   │   └── telemetry.ex            # :telemetry events for harness operations\n│   │   ├── harness.ex                  # Public API — start_session, sprint_status, etc.\n│   │   └── harness_mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex               # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 13)\n│   │       └── tools.ex                # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   └── open_sentience.ex              # Add harness supervisor to application tree\n├── test/\n│   ├── harness/\n│   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer_test.exs\n│   │   ├── quality_gate_test.exs\n│   │   ├── contract_validator_test.exs\n│   │   ├── sprint_controller_test.exs\n│   │   ├── context_manager_test.exs\n│   │   ├── coverage_test.exs\n│   │   └── session_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_governance.json   # [&] governance block\n│       ├── sprint_contract.json               # Sample sprint contract\n│       └── coverage_scenarios.json            # Coverage→dispatch test cases\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-83419","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-117356","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-83420","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-117357","text":"Phase 1: Pipeline Enforcer (weeks 1-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-83421","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83423","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117358","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement PipelineEnforcer"},{"id":"spn-117359","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-117360","marks":["code"],"text":"harness/pipeline_enforcer.ex"},{"id":"spn-117361","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-83422","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-83424","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83426","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117362","text":"GenServer tracking stage state machine: "},{"id":"spn-117363","marks":["code"],"text":":idle → :retrieving → :analyzing → :deliberating → :acting → :storing"}]}],"id":"blk-83425","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83428","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117364","text":"Prerequisite rules from section 5.1:"}]}],"id":"blk-83427","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83430","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117365","marks":["code"],"text":"{:any, :write}"},{"id":"spn-117366","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-117367","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :retrieve_context}"}]}],"id":"blk-83429","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83432","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117368","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :deliberate}"},{"id":"spn-117369","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-117370","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :topology_analyze}"}]}],"id":"blk-83431","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83434","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117371","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :execute_action}"},{"id":"spn-117372","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-117373","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :coverage_query}"}]}],"id":"blk-83433","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83436","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117374","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :learn_from_outcome}"},{"id":"spn-117375","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-117376","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :execute_action}"}]}],"id":"blk-83435","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83438","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117377","marks":["code"],"text":"{:session, :complete}"},{"id":"spn-117378","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-117379","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :store_node}"}]}],"id":"blk-83437","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83440","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117380","marks":["code"],"text":"{:sprint, :advance}"},{"id":"spn-117381","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-117382","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :quality_gate, result: :pass}"}]}],"id":"blk-83439","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83442","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117383","marks":["code"],"text":"check_prerequisite/3"},{"id":"spn-117384","text":" returns "},{"id":"spn-117385","marks":["code"],"text":"{:allow, state}"},{"id":"spn-117386","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-117387","marks":["code"],"text":"{:block, reason, state}"}]}],"id":"blk-83441","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83444","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117388","text":"Tracks violations as audit entries"}]}],"id":"blk-83443","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83446","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117389","text":"Wraps MCP tool dispatch — called before every tool invocation"}]}],"id":"blk-83445","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-83447","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83449","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117390","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement the two enforced pipelines"},{"id":"spn-117391","text":" (section 3)"}]}],"id":"blk-83448","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-83450","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117392","text":"Reactive pipeline: "},{"id":"spn-117393","marks":["code"],"text":"query |> recall |> topology |> deliberate(if κ>0) |> store"}]}],"id":"blk-83451","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83454","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117394","text":"Proactive pipeline: "},{"id":"spn-117395","marks":["code"],"text":"heartbeat |> survey |> triage |> dispatch |> store"}]}],"id":"blk-83453","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83456","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117396","text":"Coverage→dispatch routing matrix (section 3.3) — 10 routing rules"}]}],"id":"blk-83455","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-83457","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83459","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117397","marks":["bold"],"text":"Integration with OS-006"},{"id":"spn-117398","text":" (section 5.3)"}]}],"id":"blk-83458","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-83460","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83462","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117399","text":"OS-008 PipelineEnforcer runs BEFORE OS-006 PermissionEngine"}]}],"id":